@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process sale"

[*] --> WaitingForNewSale

state WaitingForNewSale
state AddingItems
state WaitingForPayment
state PaymentVerification
state SaleComplete

WaitingForNewSale --> AddingItems : new sale received
AddingItems --> WaitingForPayment : all items added
WaitingForPayment --> SaleComplete : cash payment
WaitingForPayment --> PaymentVerification : card or check payment

PaymentVerification --> SaleComplete : payment approved
SaleComplete --> WaitingForNewSale : sale finished

@enduml
